  "sampling": "Ten frozen compiler seeds for seeded Qiskit configurations, one fresh outcome per deterministic configuration. Microprobes use the first seed.",
  "lifecycle": "One diagnostic outcome per fresh process, no warmups; not full-case protocol acceptance. No best-of selection.",
  "resource_policy": "Frozen CPU1-FP64, 16 GiB, original cumulative wall cap per configuration/input, 120 seconds per instrumented compilation, strict P0 supervisor.",
